 comboFont:20,comboTop:22,comboGap:4,comboPop:.3,comboPopLife:.18,comboGrow:.08,comboLostLife:.7,comboShatter:22,comboPopGap:28, // counter under the boss bar: size, baseline below the HUD line, number-label gap, pop on increment (scale, s), growth per milestone, break fade (s), shatter spread, gap to its pops
