 shieldArc:Math.PI/2,shieldStart:-Math.PI/2,shieldGap:9,shieldWidth:9,shieldSheen:.3,shieldSheenSpeed:1.2,shieldCracks:GUARD_RULES.CRACK_STAGES+1,shieldReform:GUARD.exposedSeconds,shieldSparks:10,shieldShards:12,shieldFade:.4,shieldPop:1.6,barkHitLife:.25,barkSize:1.15,paintedWidth:2,paintedLift:.68,paintedJolt:3,paintedShade:.3, // round 3: painted arc width per plate chord (round 4 tried 1.5; round 6 back to 2, owner 2026-11-18 'Why didn't we use the previous shield?'), its anchor row, hit jolt px (Look round pick); round 5 moved the shield bar to the HUD (rumble-hud-data.js shield)
